      "arabic": "قال أبو عمر: روت عنها قدامة أنها كانت تؤمّ النساء وتقوم وسطهن «١»، يقال: إنها أدركت النبيّ ﷺ.",
      "english": "Abu Umar said: Qudama narrated from her that she used to lead the women in prayer and stand in their midst. It is said that she lived into the time of the Prophet (may Allah bless him and grant him peace).",
